msgid ""
"There were {} of {} ancestors ({}) found.\n"
"Only individual ancestors were counted. Duplicates caused by pedigree "
"collapse were ignored."
msgstr ""
"Bolo nájdených {} z {} predkov ({}).\n"
"Počítali sa len jednotliví predkovia. Duplikáty spôsobené kolapsom rodokmeňa "
"boli ignorované."
